ng the panda character from the image. The poster should include dynamic poses, intense lighting, and dramatic shadows to convey action. Use bold fonts for the stylized title \"Panda Strike\" and add a tagline such as \"When danger strikes, one panda stands alone!\" Include additional text elements typical of movie posters, such as quotes and credits.", "**Instructions for Movie Poster Transformation:**\n\n1. **Title**: \"Kung Fu Fuzz: The Rise of Panda Power\"  \n   - Stylize the title in bold, dynamic lettering with a slight curve, using a mix of red and gold gradients to evoke an action-packed vibe. Add claw marks slashing through the text for effect.\n\n2. **Background**: Replace the beige background with a dramatic mountain range at sunset, featuring a glowing pagoda on a cliff and cherry blossom petals floating in the wind.\n\n3. **Main Subject**: Position the panda as the central character, emphasizing its fluffy yet strong appearance. Add a red kung fu headband across its forehead and faint glowing fists to suggest mystical powers.\n\n4. **Tagline**: \"He’s soft, he’s strong, and he’s ready to brawl!\"  \n   - Place this tagline near the top of the poster in smaller, italicized text.\n\n5. **Additional Text**:  \n   - \"From the creators of *Furry Legends* and *Bear Strike*.\"  \n   - “Critics are roaring: ‘A hilarious, action-packed adventure!’ - Panda Times”  \n   - “Coming to theaters this summer.”  \n   - Include a small credit block at the bottom with fictional production names like \"Fluffy Action Studios\" and \"Bamboo Entertainment.\"\n\n6. **Lighting Effects**: Add glowing streaks of light around the panda to create a sense of movement and energy. Include faint action lines around its raised arms to suggest combat readiness.\n\n7. **Final Touches**: Add a subtle bamboo forest silhouette at the bottom of the poster to tie in the setting."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 75, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [497.9918212890625, 376.9729919433594], "pos": [-4075.482177734375, 5915.6484375], "id": 37, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [20], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [936009662282764, "randomize", 20, 1, "euler_ancestral", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 35, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 12, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 13, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 40, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}], "flags": {}, "type": "KSampler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [347.5439453125, 474.000244140625], "pos": [-3292.844970703125, 5198.896484375], "id": 11, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.38", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [62], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["auto", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 77, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [320.9355773925781, 355], "pos": [-4405.28125, 6361.36474609375], "id": 38, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "a4deda80f0af60fac6e6c169bbc434c33e393bdf", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [40], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [1], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 56, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RepeatLatentBatch", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [251.60223388671875, 58], "pos": [-3604.294921875, 5700.0439453125], "id": 28, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.42", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RepeatLatentBatch"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["创建一个动作电影海报，其中包含图像中的熊猫角色。海报应包括动态姿势，强烈的照明和戏剧性的阴影，以传达动作。使用大胆的字体进行风格化的标题“熊猫罢工”，并添加标语，例如“当危险罢工时，一个熊猫独自一人！”包括典型的电影海报的其他文本元素，例如报价和信用。", "**电影海报转换的说明：**\n\n1。**标题**：“功夫富夫：熊猫力量的崛起”  \n    - 用红色和金色梯度的混合物唤起动作包装的氛围，以大胆的动态字体对标题进行样式化。添加爪标记在文本中斜线以效果。\n\n2。**背景**：在日落时用戏剧性的山脉代替米色背景，在悬崖上有发光的宝塔和樱花花瓣在风中漂浮。\n\n3。**主要主题**：将熊猫定位为中心特征，强调其蓬松而强壮的外观。在其额头上添加红色功夫头带，并发出淡淡的拳头，以暗示神秘的力量。\n\n4。  \n    - 将此标语放在海报顶部附近，较小的斜体文本。\n\n5。**附加文本**：  \n    - “来自 *Furry Legends *和 *Bear Strike *的创建者。”  \n    - “批评家咆哮：‘一次有趣，充满动感的冒险！’ - 熊猫时代”  \n    - “今年夏天来剧院。”  \n    - 在底部有一个小的信用块，上面有虚构的制作名称，例如“蓬松的动作工作室”和“竹娱乐”。\n\n6。**照明效果**：在熊猫周围添加光彩条纹，以产生一种运动和能量感。在其抬高的武器周围包括微弱的动作线，以建议战斗就绪。\n\n7。**最终触摸**：在海报底部添加一个微妙的竹林轮廓以在环境中绑扎。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 62, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [497.9918212890625, 376.9729919433594], "pos": [-4068.16015625, 6347.56640625], "id": 39, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [55, 67], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask